{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1000_p", "source_sha256": "25337f64591b75e25c5c22dc3159cffaa6791d8be18b7d9225daf15a37cf7399", "ja": "（今回の衣装は、茜の要望をこれでもかと詰め込んだ。\n関わった人全員の、汗と涙の結晶と言えるな……）", "zh": "（这次的服装把茜的要求全都尽可能地融入了进去。可以说是所有参与者的汗水与泪水凝聚而成的结晶吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "35685910bbae670fcc6240aa54a904dc1bc9e82356a660239c348c11faa128b4", "ja": "おお……おおお……！　いけない。これはいけないよ。\nこんな衣装を着たら、さすがに感動しちゃう！", "zh": "哦……哦哦哦……！不行，这可不行。穿上这么棒的服装，实在是会让人感动啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "980367f886e61906a641cbde911776e96d34d2494b6baf20844a1cc810cb079c", "ja": "これは、茜ちゃんの軌跡……茜ちゃんの存在証明！\n茜ちゃんのための衣装！　文句無しの100万点！", "zh": "这是小茜的轨迹……也是小茜存在的证明！\n为小茜打造的服装！无可挑剔的100万分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7976f3475805fffdfbd36f3ccf8c44786d0613ace75d3c926a90dc18dc6e38e6", "ja": "それはよかった。\n要望をひとつにまとめるのは、さすがに苦労したよ。", "zh": "那就好。\n要把各种要求汇总成一个，确实费了不少功夫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "bbd52ffd197c478114f7647fa2991219c5ab6f58fe69302b448a5c089511fb0c", "ja": "うんうん。{$P$}ちゃんの苦労は\n無駄じゃなかった。存分に自分を褒めてあげて！", "zh": "嗯嗯。{$P$}的辛苦没有白费。\n尽情夸夸自己吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "c23d18530a10bcdcf0fdc42c8ce68ce2d22b4ce000388094992989e80a9f68e1", "ja": "そしてご褒美に、このラブリーでキュートな姿を\n遠慮なく目に焼きつけるといいよ！", "zh": "作为奖励，就尽管把我这副可爱又俏皮的模样深深印在眼里吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1006_p", "source_sha256": "86340fb171d2a1113710253023911d48ded3d2dfea1fc3a465d2e758d2492f3b", "ja": "はは、ありがとうな。\nそれにしても、すごかったな……茜の要望。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你。\n不过话说回来……茜的要求还真是厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1007_p", "source_sha256": "46d24266d33939765905c136655cef6e5379e382354993e2f37dfda343979115", "ja": "これまでの衣装の解説がはじまったと思ったら、\nどこかしらに取り入れてほしいって……。", "zh": "我还以为要开始讲解之前的服装了，没想到她却说，希望能在某个地方加进去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "40d28d1223144798df9d5205ea9157aa1583c1e1a979a146a4e59185bd4e8a8d", "ja": "茜ちゃんはね。常に前しか見てないように見えるけど\nちゃーんと周りも見てるんだよ。", "zh": "小茜呢。看起来总是只顾着往前看，但其实也好好观察着周围哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "063ece8c60dbb9ebe8e9332d983c099bd523f416b797316b09c95e56eeae453a", "ja": "どこでどんなカワイさでメロメロにしたのか……\nそれを把握することも、大事なお仕事なのです。", "zh": "掌握自己是在什么地方、用怎样的可爱把人迷得神魂颠倒的……也是很重要的工作哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "91a53963f1312ae40850e76a41e4bba7a164d140c003384a65678e9559113562", "ja": "そうじゃなきゃ、ニュースタイルな茜ちゃんを\nお披露目する機会を逃しちゃうからね♪", "zh": "不然的话，就会错过让全新风格的小茜亮相的机会呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1011_p", "source_sha256": "88a8ba4b52c69138d145a6bc43bac6f2853ed208b7033d405f82769ccfbe185b", "ja": "なるほど……。\nそれが茜の自己表現にも活かされてるんだな。", "zh": "原来如此……。\n这也运用到了茜自我表现上啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b99482799be571472fab86e2c6c4e7eee79b85399eb2e0163e59b095a42a8ff2", "ja": "てっきり、これまでの活躍のおかげで今がある……\nみたいな話になるかと思ったよ。", "zh": "我还以为会说，是因为过去的表现，才有了现在……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "96da695364574cd690f464c3b620437eb64d2e26a7db7093cc987dbc052dcb9c", "ja": "もちろんそれもあるよ？　でも、いつだって\n最高を塗り替えるのは、茜ちゃん自身だもん！", "zh": "当然也有这个原因啦？不过，无论什么时候，刷新最高纪录的都是小茜自己嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "ba0ca65f78ee9bac92a41d38452f8ea5949fe2923888bfac362fdb319ab169bb", "ja": "この衣装はね、茜ちゃんからのメッセージなんだよ。", "zh": "这套服装啊，是来自小茜的讯息哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c591e8737515c509021a1c509fa2359a8e4162fd937b58b1a2b5768659582deb", "ja": "メッセージ？", "zh": "消息？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "f1e6a4a3458fa03b64e23eeaf88be1ef2fdad61b35d17196a3ac2e62b7c6ef6d", "ja": "そう。茜ちゃんの才能に限界は無い……\n常に新鮮なカワイさを届ける自信があるって。", "zh": "没错。小茜的才能没有极限……\n还说自己有信心不断带来新鲜的可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "fcd3f95b80592ca1cf3bc7bbaed4b8a242ecd1f451d1663bb0d16bf086984d1b", "ja": "というわけで！　最高の衣装を作ってくれた\n{$P$}ちゃんにお礼をします！", "zh": "所以！要向为我制作出最棒服装的{$P$}表示感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5a7eff31bc98ecd5c4854c9c5f27aff97d63d25320aa743a430131dcabc7e0b7", "ja": "えっ、お礼？", "zh": "咦，谢礼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "1e947390b05347d0529a0650e0269c6a34622dba2704a26194d61252eb928a07", "ja": "茜ちゃんが考えに考え抜いたお礼、それは……！\nドゥルドゥルドゥルドゥル、ジャン！", "zh": "小茜绞尽脑汁想出来的谢礼，那就是……！\n咚噜咚噜咚噜咚噜，锵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "594b1de5668b651506bd049f8db522d2c6c14465a04d5f2deea594dade967d4b", "ja": "レベルアップした茜ちゃんを\n一番最初にナデナデする権利をあげちゃいまーす☆", "zh": "我就把第一个摸摸升级后的小茜的权利送给你啦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0b4d9c5f13b774c266c2804a613dbf15d03f8b51007497b5e3385699cddbf2e1", "ja": "……おお。それは嬉しいな。", "zh": "……哦。那我可真高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "b6f1c84ba7c3c87f6a76bcda668b769127b4cdfa1cd8c7478613b3e5526c6ecb", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんには、今後も頑張って\nもらわないとだからね！　さあさあ、遠慮なく～♪", "zh": "{$P$}今后也得继续加油才行\n呢！来来，别客气～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0524_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7062492227af11d36fd5c03275e8889ab04f77f81b00845bb581d658292d7532", "ja": "（茜の魅力は無限大だ……。留まることをしらない\n茜に置いてかれないように、俺も精進しないと！）", "zh": "（茜的魅力是无穷无尽的……。为了不被永远不知停歇的茜甩在身后，我也得更加努力才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
